        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p5_s3"
      },
      "text": "Analysis of this file revealed it to be Derusbi malware (a favorite RAT of DEEP PANDA) that used the domain vpn[.]foundationssl[.]com for its C2.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
