        "page": 5,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p5_s4"
      },
      "text": "At the time of discovery, CrowdStrike did not attribute the file to DEEP PANDA based on the malware alone, but the use of the DTOPTOOLZ certificate to sign a malware variant known to be heavily used by this adversary makes it likely that this signed",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
